talar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131, widget'lar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 ve vitrinlerinizi markan\u0131za uyacak \u015fekilde \u00f6zelle\u015ftirin."],"Already use Reviewbird?":["Zaten Reviewbird kullan\u0131yor musunuz?"],"Sign in":["Giri\u015f yap"],"Loading Reviewbird\u2026":["Reviewbird y\u00fckleniyor\u2026"],"(opens in a new tab)":["(yeni sekmede a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r)"],"Plugin settings":["Eklenti ayarlar\u0131"],"Let's turn your WooCommerce product reviews up to 11.":["WooCommerce \u00fcr\u00fcn incelemelerinizi en \u00fcst seviyeye \u00e7\u0131karal\u0131m."],"Automated review requests help you collect reviews automatically after each order. No busywork, just reliable review collection on autopilot.":["Otomatik inceleme talepleri, her sipari\u015ften sonra otomatik olarak inceleme toplaman\u0131za yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. Yo\u011fun i\u015f yok, sadece g\u00fcvenilir otomatik inceleme toplama."],"Get started free":["\u00dccretsiz ba\u015flay\u0131n"],"Example Reviewbird product review request email":["Aster & Oak i\u00e7in \u00d6rnek Reviewbird \u00fcr\u00fcn inceleme iste\u011fi e-postas\u0131"],"Reviewbird <store>for Aster & Oak<\/store>":["Reviewbird <store>Aster & Oak i\u00e7in<\/store>"],"To: jamie@example.com":["Kime: jamie@example.com"],"Review request":["\u0130nceleme talebi"],"How is your new blanket?":["Yeni battaniyeniz nas\u0131l?"],"Share your experience to help other shoppers choose.":["Di\u011fer al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f\u00e7ilere yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\u00e7in deneyiminizi payla\u015f\u0131n."],"Linen Throw Blanket, Sage":["Keten Atma Battaniyesi, Ada\u00e7ay\u0131"],"Poor":["K\u00f6t\u00fc"],"Great":["Harika"],"You received this review request after your purchase from Aster & Oak.":["Bu inceleme talebini Aster & Oak'tan yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z al\u0131\u015fveri\u015ften sonra ald\u0131n\u0131z."],"Unsubscribe from review emails":["\u0130nceleme e-postalar\u0131ndan aboneli\u011fi iptal et"]}}}